# Links that the link check of this repository skips, one regular expression per
# line, each with its reason above it. The rules of every repository are in lychee.toml.

# The German website is built from docs/index.de.md and exists once this is merged
# and the Docs workflow has published it; a pull request can't reach it yet.
^https://dennis-otto\.github\.io/player-switch-for-autodarts/de/

# The workflow that delivers a release to the Chrome Web Store, linked from
# docs/releases.md; it exists on main once the pull request that adds it is merged.
^https://(github\.com|raw\.githubusercontent\.com)/Dennis-Otto/player-switch-for-autodarts/(blob/)?main/\.github/workflows/publish-store\.yml$
